             * Until now an errored intent check produced a self-dismissing
             * toast and nothing else, so the tile that had just been showing
             * "Checking availability" went back to showing nothing at all —
             * indistinguishable from a check that never ran. The three verdicts
             * an intent check can reach (available / not available / could not
             * be determined) now each land in the same box in the same place,
             * differing only in colour, which is the shape the other three
             * platforms render.
             *
             * `role="alert"`, not `role="status"`: unlike its two siblings this
